<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-02T07:51:33.769Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:51:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mawisley militias have withdrawn from front lines in central Somalia while Puntland mercenaries are reported fighting alongside Sudanese RSF forces, and Sudan’s army says fighters from northern Somalia back the RSF. The United States has joined an East African nation in conducting airstrikes against a $100 million-earning group linked to the 9/11 attacks, and the UAE carried out its first drone strike against al-Shabaab in nearly a year. Somali pirates seized an Iranian fishing vessel, rescuing seven Pakistani crew members, and the UN political mission in Somalia ended after three decades. Uganda and Ethiopia are pulling their troops out after long deployments, and the African Union is withdrawing from four Lower Shabelle bases. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQempzNzlvSXprcDlaYmlxa3I2T29Ka21FNjIyMXI2Sl9aQUw3eXJWSFp2b1g4VVdubm1wRU9UQXN1bnJSRlhYQ01wdlEyVWI3QkM4UHBrem1zMEF1aDJZQmwtOVI2LTZZWlFHY3c3WGtKSGJNTVozRzQ1cEJ1M1VkQXpGZ08wSWNYcEhMQUx3U2VETXFELXlzRFJXVVkzSmR5UUJmRXhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQN1U5NzFWNklOSmFZdFBFcDJoX2JJYUJ3eHFJT0Zla2RzdEdabi1hZXJ0eEplekRpR3ZYMDBuWXJNejJHOWlyazJBTFlLVjQ1bUlXZTVSVTZPdUVLcktEUXJGbjN5UVVCLThLemNaSi1TT1ota2RpNXlwVTlYNnBIeC1sX2RnQmtkcXp1SW40dnlxM0l1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Insider Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE93aExOVUdvU0hpXzRrTTlZM3FHbzlESTFkdl9Qa2FNVDcxOHljSDBrSWhSUElkX25CY2RNdkJwdkhIU0huVmpUVG1WM2hIU1VWemc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNUVVPNkhZTVY0djFVNUtENElXNUNIUlB